      Set, (#ShelfWidth>0)&(#ShelfWidth<=#ShelfLength1B) & (#ShelfDepth>#ShelfDepthA)&(#ShelfDepth<=#ShelfDepthB): #CostOfHorizontal = #ShelfCost1B ,Set the Cost of This Shelf
