      Set, (#ShelfWidth>#ShelfLength1B)&(#ShelfWidth<=#ShelfLength2B) & (#ShelfDepth>#ShelfDepthA)&(#ShelfDepth<=#ShelfDepthB): #CostOfHorizontal = #ShelfCost2B , Set the Cost of This Shelf
