      DisplaySet, #ShelfCost8B =96.12,                    Cost of a Shelf   (up to #ShelfDepthB" deep)   by   (up to #ShelfLength8B" long), ShelfLengthDepth.Bmp
      Set, (#ShelfWidth>#ShelfLength7B)&(#ShelfWidth<=#ShelfLength8B) & (#ShelfDepth>#ShelfDepthA)&(#ShelfDepth<=#ShelfDepthB): #CostOfHorizontal = #ShelfCost8B , Set the Cost of This Shelf
