      DisplaySet, #ShelfCost1C =42*#shelfpricemultiplier,                   Cost of a Shelf   (up to #ShelfDepthC" deep)   by   (up to #ShelfLength1C" long), ShelfLengthDepth.Bmp
      Set, (#ShelfWidth>0)&(#ShelfWidth<=#ShelfLength1C) & (#ShelfDepth>#ShelfDepthB)&(#ShelfDepth<=#ShelfDepthC): #CostOfHorizontal = #ShelfCost1C ,Set the Cost of This Shelf
